# Fault f_low (writer 7): L §5.14.1 defines low(x, span) from t as min(bal(x, d) from t for d in days where ...),
# "with the same clauses": with uncertain counts the uncertain instances in low as in the bal it is the min of, so the
# two are equal. refcore printed (0.00 DUK, 1.00 DUK) for them: low dropped with uncertain.
=== f.tally
model f
  tally 2
  on 2025-05-15
  start 2025-05-15
  end 2025-06-30
unit DUK: currency minor 0.01
kind promises: transfers uncertain
place konto: accounts DUK lives 2025-05-15..
place world: outside lives 2025-05-15..
move back[m in months]: promises
  on start_of(m)
  leg cash from world to konto amount 1
ask q: (low(konto, 2025-06-01 .. 2025-06-30) from 2025-05-15 with uncertain) == min(bal(konto, d) from 2025-05-15 with uncertain for d in days where d >= 2025-06-01)
=== expect
q: true
...
